       "Build a small robotic arm or a sensor-based project"
      ]
     },
     {
      "title": "Crack engineering entrances",
      "period": "Class 12 · Entrance Exams",
      "actions": [
       "JEE Main for NITs & IIITs · JEE Advanced for the IITs",
